### !! Run the login request first so the returned token is saved as {{token}}. !!
### GET request to validate token
# Send the saved token in the Authorization header.
# Keep the Authorization header directly below the request line so IntelliJ sends it as a header, not as the request body.
#GET http://localhost:4004/auth/validate
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
GET http://lb-8c2e578d.elb.localhost.localstack.cloud:4004/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

